stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Signed: Contract signed

    Signed --> Provisioned: Phase 1<br/>SecOps + SRE<br/>~1-2 weeks
    Provisioned --> Extracting: Phase 2<br/>DBA brief + install<br/>~1 week
    Extracting --> Backfilled: Phase 3<br/>24 mo. historical<br/>~1 week
    Backfilled --> Calibrated: Phase 4<br/>Essentiality + SL targets<br/>~2 weeks

    Calibrated --> Shadow: Phase 5<br/>No writes<br/>Tier A forced

    note right of Shadow
        Exit criteria:
        • Weighted MAPE ≤ target
        • "Would approve" ≥ 70%
        • 0 isolation incidents
        • Planner sign-off
        Duration: 30–90 days
    end note

    Shadow --> ShadowBlocked: metrics miss
    ShadowBlocked --> Shadow: remediate + re-eval

    Shadow --> Canary: Phase 6<br/>tier-5 consumables<br/>< $100, single station

    note right of Canary
        Exit criteria:
        • rollback rate < 2%
        • 0 AOG incidents
        Duration: 30 days
    end note

    Canary --> CanaryBlocked: rollback spike
    CanaryBlocked --> Shadow: rollback to shadow

    Canary --> TierCExpansion: Phase 7<br/>widen §6.1 defaults<br/>weekly gates
    TierCExpansion --> TierBExpansion: Phase 8<br/>bounded autonomy<br/>~2 weeks
    TierBExpansion --> BAU: Phase 9<br/>BAU + renewal

    BAU --> [*]: Contract renewed

    BAU --> Incident: issue detected
    Incident --> BAU: incident resolved
    Incident --> Shadow: severe regression<br/>(rollback)

    Shadow --> Pause: kill switch engaged
    Canary --> Pause
    TierCExpansion --> Pause
    TierBExpansion --> Pause
    BAU --> Pause

    Pause --> Shadow: resumption review
